{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年44歲的賈曉晨（JJ）與武打影星樊少皇於2016年結婚，婚後育有兩女「小飯兜」及「小飯團」，一家四口生活低調幸福。不過賈曉晨與樊少皇近年屢傳婚變，自爆因家庭瑣事壓力大到每日「諗50次離婚」，然而二人關係似乎已雨過天晴。而大女「小飯兜」驚為天人的洋娃娃神顏常掀起熱議，近日「小飯兜」9歲生日，愈大愈靚女。</p><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨。（IG@jj_fatumai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260422/1123614132403179520026587.jpeg/1Ol0Y_UxF1nZmEFgIOhJ62YJ9ey2cAMP81cQa_NXEGs\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨。（IG@jj_fatumai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賈曉晨幫樊少皇慶生。（Weibo@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146050071112978432206984.jpeg/12WOq9G1-4bFtHJcn-LIvTZc7XazJJtZwWf0XsFn9F4\"/><figcaption>賈曉晨幫樊少皇慶生。（Weibo@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><p>賈曉晨大女「小飯兜」9歲生日獲激讚：出道吧！</p><p>JJ日前上載照片，透露近日「小飯兜」9歲生日。JJ大女遺傳了媽媽絕世美貌，眼大大鼻高高和櫻桃小嘴，五官標緻又有氣質。JJ為女兒送上士多啤梨生日蛋糕慶祝，「小飯兜」切蛋糕，臉無表情，看來個性怕羞，十分可愛。JJ又緊攬住細女合照，兩個女一樣錫。不少人為「小飯兜」送上生日祝福，並激讚：「出道吧！太美了！」</p><figure><img alt=\"JJ慶大女9歲生日。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200123145215152128824963.png/_d9CDLfekiZzrwYx9eRiMfGzz0IR_Hm7qnIbX6pyG18\"/><figcaption>JJ慶大女9歲生日。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大女切蛋糕。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200123142971068416681705.png/Iaoa4uKt5NiyokwYZS94z6dvp1V21VUqGax7lRmse5U\"/><figcaption>大女切蛋糕。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"細女都好可愛。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200123140655681536645012.png/x3LddkEiY4Q0YxBdkTVh9JrNzhcnY8krdDaFnHQ2hZw\"/><figcaption>細女都好可愛。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ好錫兩個女。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200123138646478848493057.png/6p_LOhru9DFo70pTcg5H71C-dLj3vGxU8MeNB_DHjQc\"/><figcaption>JJ好錫兩個女。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.238566+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":452,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:00:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:09.440195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:51.225930+00:00","content_hash":"87d5da72c1b197e82dacfebf7e90b2a3bcaf48496bb2c64039806e9be56e77f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}